== Notes ==
* Although she has a [[Ranger]] boss aura, she does not seem to use any [[List of ranger skills|Ranger skills]].
* After you have tamed Queen Aijundu, she will become non-hostile.  After this has occurred, she will be named simply as "Aijundu".
{{bug|She will sometimes appear as "Aijunundu" once she is tamed.}}

== Trivia ==
* There are male and female Junundu.  The females tend to be larger than the males, with the largest dominant female being called the Queen.  The Queen has her own harem of males which she considers her property.  Once the Queen becomes old or weak, another female can step up to challenge her and take over as the Queen.
